
                      DayDream BBS V1.00, Version.DAT
                      -------------------------------

 Note: Purpose of this data  file is to  supply sizes  for each and every
 data  structure  used by  DayDream  BBS and other programs supplied with
 it. Size  of  this  data file may and  will vary, so don't expect to  be
 able  to read  an exact length. New  fields will be added to  this file,
 but old ones will remain  in their offsets. Each utility or door program
 made for DayDream BBS  should refer here  for up-to-date structure sizes
 so that utilities will work also when structures grow  larger.
 Version.DAT will be  created every time  DayDream BBS is ran so it  will
 always  be up-to-date. When  accessing this  file, close  it as  soon as
 possible, and never access it in write mode.


OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   STRING     35    DAYDREAM BBS VERSION STRING                       (-)
 0036   WORD       02    CONFERENCE STRUCTURE LENGTH                       (-)
 0038   WORD       02    MESSAGE BASE STRUCTURE LENGTH                     (-)
 0040   WORD       02    USER STRUCTURE LENGTH                             (-)
 0042   WORD       02    ACCESS LEVEL STRUCTURE LENGTH                     (-)
 0044   WORD       02    FILE/DISK ARCHIVER STRUCTURE LENGTH               (-)
 0046   WORD       02    MAIN CONFIGURATION FILE (DayDream.DAT)            (-)
 0048   WORD       02    EXTERNAL COMMAND STRUCTURE LENGTH                 (-)
 0050   WORD       02    IO-DEVICE DATA FILE LENGTH                        (-)
 0052   WORD       02    MESSAGE STRUCTURE LENGTH                          (-)
 0054   WORD       02    MULTINODE STRUCTURE LENGTH                        (-)
 0056   WORD       02    EXTERNAL PROTOCOL STRUCTURE LENGTH                (-)
 0058   WORD       02    DISPLAY MODE STRUCTURE LENGTH                     (-)
 0060   WORD       02    SECURITY STRUCTURE LENGTH                         (-)
 0062   FREE BLOCK 38    FREE SPACE RESERVED FOR FUTURE DEVELOPMENT        (-)
 0100   END        00    TOTAL LENGTH: 100 BYTES                           (-)
==============================================================================
